error[elab/function-argument-name-mismatch]: function argument `g` must have the same name as declared function parameter `expected`
  ┌─ elab/type-funarg-name-mismatch.watsup:5:18
  │
4 │ dec $caller(def $expected : nat) : nat
  │                  -------- function parameter declared here
5 │ def $caller(def $g) = 0
